# TrackIR / SmartNav USB device permissions
# Grants access to all NaturalPoint (vendor 131d) USB devices.
# MODE=0666 provides universal rw access; TAG+=uaccess delegates to
# systemd-logind for seat-aware permission grants.
# Using SUBSYSTEMS=="usb" and ATTRS is more robust for modern distros.
SUBSYSTEMS=="usb", ATTRS{idVendor}="131d", MODE="0666", GROUP="users", TAG+="uaccess", ENV{ID_MM_DEVICE_IGNORE}="1"
